Description: Uke generic FS19xx speaker preset with OEM attribution
 Exact unmodified preset whose stock ODM notice maps to Apache-2.0.
 Device-specific calibration and persist data are excluded. Existing local
 preset modifications are retained as a conffile. Playback and protection
 effectiveness remain subject to separate device qualification.
